This repository's code and Track 2 methods files are released under
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0), matching
the hackathon submission terms.

The child's genome, phenotype, and any genotype-scale tables are NOT
in this repository and are NOT licensed here. They remain under the
gated dataset terms (WCG IRB protocol #20252010) and must be deleted
within 30 days of hackathon close.

